# Never send these into a Docker build context - keeps builds fast and images small,
# and (for .env) keeps secrets out of image layers entirely.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/coverage

.git
.gitignore

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!**/.env.example

*.log
npm-debug.log*

.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

docs/
*.md
